]},{"date":"2017-02-04T15:17:32-08:00","id":1043749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1043663#post1043663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Really? My lack of Mage knowledge is indeed showing. This might offer some interesting ideas</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, to be specific the FC was formally founded on new years eve 1899.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-04T21:23:00-08:00","id":1043849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1043659#post1043659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">4 - Hard to say. Sometimes it's one, sometimes it's the other. I think I'm going to use it as the Supernal Realms, because other myths already offer plenty of material for Changeling.</div> </div> </div> </div>With what then Supernal Realm you would equate this Heaven? Is it more or like Christian like or other? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1043663#post1043663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Really? My lack of Mage knowledge is indeed showing. This might offer some interesting ideas</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1043749#post1043749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, to be specific the FC was formally founded on new years eve 1899.</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically, Free Council was formed on 1900 New Years day. Great Refusal - worldwide terrorist attacks on Seers - were in New Year's Eve of 1899. Practically, Free Council becomes part of Pentacle on European Convocation ( I would put on June) later in the 1900, where Europe's Diamond acknowledged them. Rest of world followed with European standard, so by the end of 1900 - Free Council is global partner for Diamond in Alliance called Pentacle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-04T21:35:58-08:00","id":1043854,"title":"","content":"Reading about Congo history, interesting would be making Free Council NOT join Diamond in it, as Council is local Nameless reforming in to free Libertines and Diamond is foreign power, connected with colonialism. Creation of Pentacle alliance was EUROPEAN standard and Congo's people did not wanted to follow their foot steps ( because of actions of King Leopold ), at least on beginning.<br /> <br /> Question remains - <b>If people of Congo were having longer contacts with Europeans <i>before</i> XIX century?</b> If yes, then most of Awakened in country will be already Diamond and Seers mages - their Global Orders are just <i>this </i>powerful. If not, then most of Congo will be Nameless and new emerging Free Council can be literal force locally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-05-2017, 12:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-05T01:31:39-08:00","id":1043889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1043849#post1043849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Technically, Free Council was formed on 1900 New Years day. Great Refusal - worldwide terrorist attacks on Seers - were in New Year's Eve of 1899.</div> </div> </div> </div>Neither of those is correct. It's always referred to as the New Years Eve declaration, and the attack on the Seers happened before that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-05T04:11:46-08:00","id":1043915,"title":"","content":"<i>No</i>, Great Refusal <i>was</i> worldwide terrorist attack on Seers on New Year's Eve of 1899. Here are quotes from Free Council Origins sections of 2E corebook:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MtAw 2E, p. 51</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Seers saw their chance to rid the world of the very idea of the occult, sealing the Fallen World\u2019s cracks and completely controlling the Awakening. <b>The simultaneous answer of the Nameless came on New Year\u2019s Eve, 1899: <i>No</i>. The Great Refusal was unanimous (if only because the columns who accepted the offer were quietly, brutally purged) and refocused the nascent war efforts against the Seers. Within a decade, the Nameless Wars had ended.</b> Convocations offered support and assimilation to Nameless columns, while the Silver Ladder worked to support the allied Assemblies and Nameless Orders as a true fifth Order. The Diamond became a Pentacle, albeit with a point that drew on the Supernal weight of human society and innovation rather than magically emulating a caste of an Awakened City.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would see that in Congo, Nameless War was <i>very</i> long, lasting in hot to 1909 or 1910, with only year or two earlier Sleepers government agreeing to being annexed into Belgium State as Belgium Congo. With probably Free Council being more eager to rise tensions and smaller revolts in Pentacle society than in rest of world up until Republic in 1960's ( well, maybe not higher in London, but there rules Guardians over 'white Brits' and treating any citizens of color as Free Council 'wild marauders' ). I would envision Libertines in Congo always ready to speak their mind and doing more than one rebellions against Diamond <i>after </i>1908.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-05-2017, 07:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-05T15:47:36-08:00","id":1044235,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1043849#post1043849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> With what then Supernal Realm you would equate this Heaven? Is it more or like Christian like or other?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>It's a Place Above. Not a real corrispondence with any specific Supernal Realm. God lives there, but the details are hazy and not universal. I'll think about it some more, but my idea was to keep it a vague &quot;Supernal&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1043854#post1043854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Question remains - <b>If people of Congo were having longer contacts with Europeans <i>before</i> XIX century?</b> If yes, then most of Awakened in country will be already Diamond and Seers mages - their Global Orders are just <i>this </i>powerful. If not, then most of Congo will be Nameless and new emerging Free Council can be literal force locally.</div> </div> </div> </div>By almost all accounts, the answer is no. Some few contacts here and there across history with people from other countries (mostly Arabs) but before XIX people in the Congo basin can be said to be basically unaware of the existence of the Europeans.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1043915#post1043915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[I]<br /> I would see that in Congo, Nameless War was <i>very</i> long, lasting in hot to 1909 or 1910, with only year or two earlier Sleepers government agreeing to being annexed into Belgium State as Belgium Congo. With probably Free Council being more eager to rise tensions and smaller revolts in Pentacle society than in rest of world up until Republic in 1960's ( well, maybe not higher in London, but there rules Guardians over 'white Brits' and treating any citizens of color as Free Council 'wild marauders' ). I would envision Libertines in Congo always ready to speak their mind and doing more than one rebellions against Diamond <i>after </i>1908.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I do find potential in the Free Council (or the orders that would become the Free Council) using the &quot;Congo question&quot; as a battlefield both moral and practical for the ideals and the interests of the organization, I don't think portraying the conflict as a &quot;Pentacle whites&quot; and &quot;african or pro-african Free Council&quot; is a good idea. I do see a narrative in there where the colonialist forces of the Pentacle are called out by the Free Council for imposing the Diamond's model on the Congolese mages, but to sharply divide it that way is both not in line with what really happened and I also believe takes out some fuel for conflict and struggles. The story of the Congo Free State is, to be blunt, a huge mess, rife with complexities, heroism and atrocities.<br /> <br /> I fully intend for my work on the Dark Era to reflect that, since it's both part of the theme I have in mind and, most importantly, does justice to the events that actually happened<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-05T19:03:59-08:00","id":1044321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1044235#post1044235\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a Place Above. Not a real corrispondence with any specific Supernal Realm. God lives there, but the details are hazy and not universal. I'll think about it some more, but my idea was to keep it a vague &quot;Supernal&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>It's clouding everything, as 'everything in universe' do not point you to specific powers or traits to based faction on. For doing Nameless Order you may point to typical traits of those kind of 'doctors' dedicated to this Place Above?<br /> <br /> If there will be any other pointing out, I would still proposed Obrimos Aether Emanation Realm, as it's connected with idea of flying and storms. In previous could also worked Arcadia, as it was 7 milenia earlier the Path of Winds ( see <i>Sundered World</i> Dark Era for more on this ).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1044235#post1044235\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By almost all accounts, the answer is no. Some few contacts here and there across history with people from other countries (mostly Arabs) but before XIX people in the Congo basin can be said to be basically unaware of the existence of the Europeans.</div> </div> </div> </div>Few contacts is still few possible local mages, even from Arab world - remember, Diamond Orders emerged from <b>WHOLE</b> once Alexander's Empire territory. But if Arabs did not made massive conversions of Congo people, we can still be left with 'we only have a few dozens of Diamond in locations were cultural exchanges were made - rest did not get dedicated enough to go in land'.<br /> <br /> Also, remember that Mysterium very likes to travel, if they got Mystery, Temple of Time Before, &lt;Any other local Obsession&gt; - they will get almost <i>everywhere</i> in the world. They numbers can be little, but with any contact from previous Alexander's Empire powers, there <i>will be</i> some Diamond and Seers mages.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1042318-africa?p=1044235#post1044235\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I do find potential in the Free Council (or the orders that would become the Free Council) using the &quot;Congo question&quot; as a battlefield both moral and practical for the ideals and the interests of the organization, I don't think portraying the conflict as a &quot;Pentacle whites&quot; and &quot;african or pro-african Free Council&quot; is a good idea. I do see a narrative in there where the colonialist forces of the Pentacle are called out by the Free Council for imposing the Diamond's model on the Congolese mages, but to sharply divide it that way is both not in line with what really happened and I also believe takes out some fuel for conflict and struggles. The story of the Congo Free State is, to be blunt, a huge mess, rife with complexities, heroism and atrocities.<br /> <br /> I fully intend for my work on the Dark Era to reflect that, since it's both part of the theme I have in mind and, most importantly, does justice to the events that actually happened.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let's get terminology straight:<br /> <br /> <b>Diamond</b> - 'old school' Orders tactical and philosophical alliance, based on members Orders believe in that they reflect Perfect Society of Atlantis. I. E. Sect 1. Created somewhere in circa 200 BCE ( probably Roman Republic in Golden Age ).<br /> <br /> <b>Free Council</b> - Order made of previous Nameless in 1900, I. E. mages that Diamond did not want, they did not wanted Diamond or never before even heard of Diamond. Based on ideas of direct democracy. Also, Sect 2.<br /> <br /> <b>Seers of Throne</b> - Order &amp; sect 3 opposing two before on notion of serving Reality Tyrants. Created in Ancient Roman Empire.<br /> <br /> <b>Pentacle </b>- Tactical alliance of Diamond and Free Council against Seers of Throne. Prone to be partially stopped if Seers are not in vicinity and Diamond and Council dogma clash a bit more. Long lasting effect of Nameless War of XIX century and European Convocations of year 1900.<br /> <br /> With that in mind, 'white colonist' mages were Diamond and Seers, as there will not be any Pentacle till 1900 - <i>there were no</i> Free Council to make alliance with Diamond till that date. I proposed so that local Pentacle ALLIANCE formed much longer than in rest of the world, with Congo being divided in many factions.<br /> <br /> For example, I think you need to make write-ups for those Nameless Orders as their members only <i>in part</i> went to created Free Council - this part that likes democracy idea. Rest of Nameless in Nameless Orders would not join nor Free Council, nor Diamond, nor Seers. Well, rest beside those particulars that joined those groups. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It's individual' mage's decision - some will join Free Council, some will go with Diamond, some will join Seers - and some will remain Nameless and stick to their old ways. Looking only on history of region, I would say that 'some will join Free Council' will be a <i>very</i> big 'some'. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-05-2017, 10:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-05T19:58:37-08:00","id":1044342,"title":"","content":"There is also one thing to take in consideration - Congo is not in vacuum. Near to it's boarders there is previously <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1044366-dark-eras-mutapa-kingdom\">Mutapa Empire</a> that in XV was heavily exposed by Europeans. And by this they probably bring Diamond &amp; Seers with them.<br /> <br /> Spread of local African Diamond Orders would change our Diamond-to-Nameless in Congo. In <b>Dark Eras Companion</b> will be chapter about Mutapa Empire, maybe we will read more about Diamond expansion on Africa. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-06-2017, 12:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}